window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>After the night of her life with a dirty, sexy stranger who’s supposed to live a world and a half away from her, Tori is feeling pretty damn smug - until she finds him in the office next door.</p> <p>Bryant is a menace, making every woman in the entire building lose focus, but she never thought he would actually go after her assistant.</p> <p>Determined to save the poor girl from his clutches, she confronts him and finds herself thrust in a world she never knew existed.</p> <p>Bryant should stay away from the sweet, little, prim-and-proper thing wrapped in designer suits, but he’s had a taste, and he can’t seem to forget it. He knows there’s no way he can even pretend to be satisfied with a vanilla relationship. Good thing that when the clothes and the attitude come off, Tori might very well be a sub. All he needs is to lead her down the rabbit hole....</p>"; 
